<title>THAILAND: TelecomAsia posts 1.92 bln baht yr loss.</title>
<headline>TelecomAsia posts 1.92 bln baht yr loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss	 0.87	vs     profit	0.58</p>
<p>    Net	   loss   1,924.12	vs     profit  1,290.70</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is TelecomAsia Plc, operator of fixed telephone lines.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
